  "notes": "{上|あ}げる is a highly versatile verb with multiple meanings and uses.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{上|あ}がる→上がる：00615_agaru⟧ (intransitive, to rise)\n\nUSAGE:\n1. To raise/lift: ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{上|あ}げる (raise one's hand)\n2. To give: ⟦プレゼント→プレゼント：01791_purezento⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{上|あ}げる (give a present)\n3. To improve: ⟦{効率|こうりつ}→効率：11794_kouritsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{上|あ}げる (raise efficiency)\nWhen giving to social superiors, use ⟦{差|さ}し{上|あ}げる→差し上げる：01597_sashiageru⟧ instead.\n\nAUXILIARY USE:\n〜て{上|あ}げる expresses doing something for someone's benefit (speaker → other):\n- ⟦{教|おし}えて→教える：00526_oshieru⟧{上|あ}げる: to teach (for someone)\n- ⟦{手伝|てつだ}って→手伝う：00898_tetsudau⟧{上|あ}げる: to help (for someone)",
